{
  "title": "Amazon Just Gave Its Tablets the Apps Fire Tablet Owners Wanted",
  "chapters": [
    {
      "number": "",
      "title": "Intro"
    },
    {
      "number": "01",
      "title": "The Few Channels"
    },
    {
      "number": "02",
      "title": "Why Amazon Changed"
    },
    {
      "number": "03",
      "title": "What You Gain"
    },
    {
      "number": "04",
      "title": "Before You Buy"
    },
    {
      "number": "",
      "title": "Close"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "A cheap tablet was never really cheap if it couldn't run your apps.",
      "emphasis": "never really cheap",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "FIRE TABLETS",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "And for years, that was the deal with Amazon's Fire tablets,",
      "emphasis": "Fire tablets",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "like a TV that only picked up a handful of channels",
      "emphasis": "handful of channels",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "television",
        "remote control"
      ],
      "label": "FEW CHANNELS",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "while everyone else had the full list.",
      "emphasis": "full list",
      "visual": "icon_grid",
      "subjects": [
        "television"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "This month, Amazon finally switched on the rest.",
      "emphasis": "switched on",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "remote control"
      ],
      "label": "OCTOBER",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "Over the next few minutes, we'll see why the old tablets felt limited,",
      "emphasis": "felt limited",
      "visual": "checklist",
      "subjects": [
        "check mark"
      ],
      "label": "ROUTE",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "claim",
      "chapter": 0,
      "text": "what made Amazon change, what you gain, and how to decide before you buy.",
      "emphasis": "how to decide",
      "visual": "checklist",
      "subjects": [
        "check mark"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 1,
      "text": "So start with what was going on inside the old Fire tablets.",
      "emphasis": "inside",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "01",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 1,
      "text": "Back then, they ran Fire OS, Amazon's own version of Android,",
      "emphasis": "Fire OS",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet",
        "gear"
      ],
      "label": "FIRE OS",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 1,
      "text": "and Android is simply what lets apps run on most tablets and phones.",
      "emphasis": "Android",
      "visual": "icon_flow",
      "subjects": [
        "gear",
        "phone",
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 1,
      "text": "But instead of Google's app store, Amazon gave you its own,",
      "emphasis": "its own",
      "visual": "split_compare",
      "subjects": [
        "box",
        "box"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 1,
      "text": "which meant fewer apps, and some that arrived late or not at all.",
      "emphasis": "fewer apps",
      "visual": "icon_grid",
      "subjects": [
        "box"
      ],
      "label": "GAPS",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 1,
      "text": "So if your bank, your school or your favourite streaming app was missing,",
      "emphasis": "missing",
      "visual": "cross_out",
      "subjects": [
        "phone"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 1,
      "text": "you either went without it or used a workaround,",
      "emphasis": "workaround",
      "visual": "icon_flow",
      "subjects": [
        "wrench",
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 1,
      "text": "meaning a riskier, unofficial way of installing it yourself.",
      "emphasis": "riskier",
      "visual": "gauge",
      "subjects": [
        "warning sign"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 1,
      "text": "And developers felt it too, with an extra version to build and fix.",
      "emphasis": "extra version",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "laptop",
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "proof",
      "chapter": 1,
      "text": "In other words, you saved money and paid for it in missing channels.",
      "emphasis": "missing channels",
      "visual": "split_compare",
      "subjects": [
        "coin",
        "television"
      ],
      "label": "THE DEAL",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 2,
      "text": "Which raises a fair question, why give up a setup that kept prices low?",
      "emphasis": "prices low",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "coin"
      ],
      "label": "02",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 2,
      "text": "Because people don't buy a tablet for itself, they buy it for the apps.",
      "emphasis": "for the apps",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet",
        "phone"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 2,
      "text": "On October eighth, twenty twenty-six, Amazon announced three new tablets,",
      "emphasis": "three new tablets",
      "visual": "icon_grid",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "OCT 8",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 2,
      "text": "the Alexa Tablet 8, the Tablet 11, and the Tablet 12 Pro,",
      "emphasis": "Tablet 12 Pro",
      "visual": "icon_grid",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 2,
      "text": "and all three run Android with Google Play built in.",
      "emphasis": "Google Play",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet",
        "box"
      ],
      "label": "GOOGLE PLAY",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 2,
      "text": "Google Play is Google's full app store, the whole channel list,",
      "emphasis": "whole channel list",
      "visual": "icon_grid",
      "subjects": [
        "television"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 2,
      "text": "which puts these tablets on equal footing with any other Android tablet.",
      "emphasis": "equal footing",
      "visual": "split_compare",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet",
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 2,
      "text": "Amazon is also aiming higher, with aluminum bodies and Alexa Plus,",
      "emphasis": "Alexa Plus",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet",
        "speaker"
      ],
      "label": "UPMARKET",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 2,
      "text": "its newer, smarter assistant, so these aren't just old tablets with new names.",
      "emphasis": "new names",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 3,
      "text": "Now bring that into an ordinary day.",
      "emphasis": "ordinary day",
      "visual": "clock",
      "subjects": [
        "clock"
      ],
      "label": "03",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 3,
      "text": "Say your family already uses YouTube, Netflix, Gmail and Google Docs.",
      "emphasis": "Google Docs",
      "visual": "icon_grid",
      "subjects": [
        "phone"
      ],
      "label": "YOUR APPS",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 3,
      "text": "With Google Play there, each one is a normal download,",
      "emphasis": "normal download",
      "visual": "icon_flow",
      "subjects": [
        "box",
        "tablet",
        "check mark"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 3,
      "text": "which means a student can open class documents straight away,",
      "emphasis": "class documents",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "book",
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "STUDENT",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 3,
      "text": "instead of hunting for a substitute and learning new menus.",
      "emphasis": "substitute",
      "visual": "cross_out",
      "subjects": [
        "phone"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 3,
      "text": "A parent gets the same streaming service the family already pays for,",
      "emphasis": "streaming service",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "television"
      ],
      "label": "PARENT",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 3,
      "text": "and nobody has to rebuild their routine from scratch.",
      "emphasis": "routine",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "calendar"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 3,
      "text": "Still, more channels don't make every programme good,",
      "emphasis": "every programme",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "television"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "pattern",
      "chapter": 3,
      "text": "because some Android apps are built for phones and look stretched on a tablet.",
      "emphasis": "stretched",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "phone",
        "tablet"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "reframe",
      "chapter": 3,
      "text": "The real win is choice without technical workarounds.",
      "emphasis": "choice",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "key"
      ],
      "label": "THE WIN",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cost",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "And that's where it can go wrong for your wallet,",
      "emphasis": "your wallet",
      "visual": "bar_chart",
      "subjects": [
        "coin"
      ],
      "label": "04",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cost",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "because the full list costs more.",
      "emphasis": "costs more",
      "visual": "bar_chart",
      "subjects": [
        "coin"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cost",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "The Alexa Tablet 8 starts at two hundred twenty-nine ninety-nine,",
      "emphasis": "Alexa Tablet 8",
      "visual": "bar_chart",
      "subjects": [
        "coin"
      ],
      "label": "$229.99",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cost",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "the Tablet 11 at three hundred twenty-nine ninety-nine,",
      "emphasis": "Tablet 11",
      "visual": "bar_chart",
      "subjects": [
        "coin"
      ],
      "label": "$329.99",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cost",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "and the Tablet 12 Pro at four hundred ninety-nine ninety-nine.",
      "emphasis": "Tablet 12 Pro",
      "visual": "bar_chart",
      "subjects": [
        "coin"
      ],
      "label": "$499.99",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cost",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "By comparison, the recent Fire HD 10 topped out",
      "emphasis": "Fire HD 10",
      "visual": "split_compare",
      "subjects": [
        "tablet",
        "coin"
      ],
      "label": "FIRE HD 10",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cost",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "around one hundred eighty dollars before discounts.",
      "emphasis": "one hundred eighty dollars",
      "visual": "split_compare",
      "subjects": [
        "coin"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "That's why a little homework before you pay is worth it, in four steps.",
      "emphasis": "four steps",
      "visual": "checklist",
      "subjects": [
        "check mark"
      ],
      "label": "4 STEPS",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "First, write down the three apps you open every single day.",
      "emphasis": "three apps",
      "visual": "checklist",
      "subjects": [
        "notebook"
      ],
      "label": "STEP 1",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "Second, search for each one in Google Play and check it supports tablets.",
      "emphasis": "supports tablets",
      "visual": "checklist",
      "subjects": [
        "magnifying glass"
      ],
      "label": "STEP 2",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "Third, compare the new price with an older Fire tablet plus workarounds.",
      "emphasis": "compare the new price",
      "visual": "checklist",
      "subjects": [
        "coin",
        "wrench"
      ],
      "label": "STEP 3",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 4,
      "text": "Finally, ask whether you'd really use Alexa Plus, or just pay for it.",
      "emphasis": "Alexa Plus",
      "visual": "checklist",
      "subjects": [
        "speaker"
      ],
      "label": "STEP 4",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "reframe",
      "chapter": 5,
      "text": "Remember this, Amazon traded some low price for the full channel list.",
      "emphasis": "full channel list",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "television"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 5,
      "text": "Your three apps tell you whether those extra channels are worth it to you.",
      "emphasis": "worth it",
      "visual": "gauge",
      "subjects": [
        "gauge"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 5,
      "text": "And if this helped, follow the channel,",
      "emphasis": "follow the channel",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "phone"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": true
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 5,
      "text": "because every week we break down tech decisions like this one.",
      "emphasis": "every week",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "phone"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": true
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 5,
      "text": "Which brings us back to that old TV,",
      "emphasis": "old TV",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "television"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "section": "cta",
      "chapter": 5,
      "text": "would you pay more for all the channels?",
      "emphasis": "all the channels",
      "visual": "logo_end",
      "subjects": [],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    }
  ]
}
